+5.  **Progressive High Resolution Ray Casting - Composite:** Generate the current image by compositing $T_{high}$ on top of $T_{low}$ using alpha blending. The blending time is negligible [S1, unofficial].
+6.  **Iteration:** In the next frame, increase the frame counter and resume from Step 3 [S1, unofficial]. Continue until sampling positions exceed volume boundaries.
 
